# WP9 sweep outputs: scored CSVs and the gate verdict are committed per
# docs/wp9-plan.md sec7; raw per-cell RunRecord JSONL is not (size), and the
# exact re-run command is recorded in the stage's own commit message.
# Derived from the CATEGORY sec7 describes ("raw per-cell JSONL is not
# committed"), not from one filename: online_rows.jsonl was 121 MB and
# would have been committed because the original pattern named only
# records.jsonl. Same species as the count-in-prose rule.
sweeps/**/*.jsonl

# LP captures are large intermediates, regenerated by capture.py
sweeps/phase2/lp-analysis-*/lps*.pkl
sweeps/**/stage6_g6_n40_records.jsonl
sweeps/**/g12.runs.jsonl
